window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Joy isn't exactly living up to her name lately.</b><br> <br> This stressed-out squirrel shifter is on a constant treadmill, struggling to pay the bills and raise her younger sister.<br> <br> Christmas at a beautiful mountain lodge sounds like exactly the medicine to cure her winter blues.<br> <br> But Fated Mountain Lodge isn't having a merry Christmas either. The heat's out, a blizzard has stranded everyone, and the lodge's very existence is threatened in a hostile takeover by a billionaire dragon shifter developer.<br> <br> Who turns out to be Joy's fated mate.<br> <br> Now, with the fate of the lodge on the line, Joy has the holiday weekend to show this sexy Scrooge the true meaning of Christmas, or it's not going to be a holly jolly holiday for anyone.<br> <br> And it turns out that he might be exactly what she needs, too.</p>"; 
